+#. Diagram element documentation
+msgid "Any coding agent with a PR ready to merge. It first checks whether a merge manager is active; if none is and one is needed, it elects one with its siblings by the fixed rule; a lone or lapsed session manages its own PRs. It never merges another session's PR, never pushes to another session's branch, and treats a merge manager that does not acknowledge within the stall window as stalled."
+msgstr ""
+
+#: sdlc/processes/merge-request.bpmn:59
+#. Diagram label
+msgid "Elect the merge manager with the siblings"
