+#. Diagram element documentation
+msgid "No merge manager is needed (a lone session, or a lapsed lane): the session is its own merge manager for its own PRs only, so it runs the merge manager loop for them. It does not announce itself to the others; it posts the six lines in its own chat and asks the owner by card."
