+#. Diagram element documentation
+msgid "To the merge manager: the PR URL and full head SHA, the session URL, 1-3 sentences on the change, the rendered preview URL or no preview with a reason, what to look for, and full tier green as judged (owner ruling, 2026-11-07). Never merge it yourself, and never push to another session's branch."
+msgstr ""
