+#: sdlc/processes/merge-request.bpmn:41
+#. Diagram element documentation
+msgid "Yes when the latest \"merge manager: <session id>\" announcement in the coordination group names a session that is live: active, and it answered within the stall window (holding.stalledAfterMinutes). The announcement is sent to every sibling and the owner, and noted durably on the coordination work item, so a newly started sibling finds it. No when there is no announcement, the holder handed over or lapsed, or the holder is stalled."
+msgstr ""
+
+#: sdlc/processes/merge-request.bpmn:86
+#. Diagram element documentation
+msgid "Yes when the merge manager acknowledged the request within the stall window. No when it did not, or its session went inactive: the lane is treated as vacant."
+msgstr ""
